        <UserObject label="" plantUmlData="{&#xa;  &quot;data&quot;: &quot;\n@startuml\ntitle Medical Representative - Doctor &amp; Visit Management\n\nleft to right direction\n\nskinparam backgroundColor #F8FAFC\nskinparam shadowing false\nskinparam actorStyle awesome\nskinparam roundcorner 18\nskinparam packageStyle rectangle\nskinparam packageBackgroundColor #EAF2F8\nskinparam packageBorderColor #4F6D8A\nskinparam packagePadding 25\nskinparam defaultFontName Arial\nskinparam linetype ortho\nskinparam nodesep 55\nskinparam ranksep 65\n\nskinparam usecase {\n    BackgroundColor #FFFFFF\n    BorderColor #4F6D8A\n    ArrowColor #4F6D8A\n    FontColor #263746\n}\n\nactor \&quot;Medical Representative\&quot; as MedRep\nactor \&quot;Integrated Communication\\nService\&quot; as Messaging\n\n&#39; ==================== ACTOR LAYOUT ====================\nMedRep -[hidden]right-&gt; Messaging\n\nrectangle \&quot;Doctor &amp; Visit Management\&quot; {\n\n    package \&quot;01 - Doctor List Management\&quot; {\n\n        usecase \&quot;Add Doctor to\\nOwn Doctor List\&quot; as DL01\n        usecase \&quot;View Own Doctor List\&quot; as DL02\n        usecase \&quot;View Doctor Profile\&quot; as DL03\n        usecase \&quot;Update Doctor Information\&quot; as DL04\n        usecase \&quot;Delete Doctor from\\nOwn Doctor List\&quot; as DL05\n\n        usecase \&quot;Validate Doctor Data\&quot; as DV01\n        usecase \&quot;Check for Duplicate Doctor\&quot; as DV02\n        usecase \&quot;Verify Access Permissions\&quot; as DV03\n    }\n\n    package \&quot;02 - Visit Management &amp; Tracking\&quot; {\n\n        usecase \&quot;Record Doctor Visit\&quot; as VM01\n        usecase \&quot;Verify Clinic Location\\nUsing GPS\&quot; as VM02\n        usecase \&quot;Record Visit Feedback\&quot; as VM03\n        usecase \&quot;Assign Doctor\\nClassification\&quot; as VM04\n        usecase \&quot;View Visit History\&quot; as VM05\n        usecase \&quot;View Plan vs Actual\\nVisit Progress\&quot; as VM06\n        usecase \&quot;Update / Reschedule Visit\&quot; as VM07\n    }\n\n    package \&quot;03 - Doctor Notifications\&quot; {\n\n        usecase \&quot;Schedule Visit Notification\&quot; as NT01\n        usecase \&quot;Send Visit Notification\\nto Doctor\&quot; as NT02\n    }\n\n    &#39;================================\n    &#39; DOCTOR LIST RELATIONSHIPS\n    &#39;================================\n\n    DL01 ..&gt; DV01 : &lt;&lt;include&gt;&gt;\n    DL01 ..&gt; DV02 : &lt;&lt;include&gt;&gt;\n    DL01 ..&gt; DV03 : &lt;&lt;include&gt;&gt;\n\n    DL02 ..&gt; DV03 : &lt;&lt;include&gt;&gt;\n    DL03 ..&gt; DV03 : &lt;&lt;include&gt;&gt;\n    DL04 ..&gt; DV01 : &lt;&lt;include&gt;&gt;\n    DL04 ..&gt; DV03 : &lt;&lt;include&gt;&gt;\n    DL05 ..&gt; DV03 : &lt;&lt;include&gt;&gt;\n\n    &#39;================================\n    &#39; VISIT RELATIONSHIPS\n    &#39;================================\n\n    VM01 ..&gt; VM02 : &lt;&lt;include&gt;&gt;\n    VM03 ..&gt; VM01 : &lt;&lt;extend&gt;&gt;\n    VM04 ..&gt; VM01 : &lt;&lt;extend&gt;&gt;\n\n    &#39;================================\n    &#39; NOTIFICATION RELATIONSHIPS\n    &#39;================================\n\n    NT02 ..&gt; NT01 : &lt;&lt;include&gt;&gt;\n}\n\n&#39;================================\n&#39; MEDICAL REPRESENTATIVE\n&#39;================================\n\nMedRep --&gt; DL01\nMedRep --&gt; DL02\nMedRep --&gt; DL03\nMedRep --&gt; DL04\nMedRep --&gt; DL05\n\nMedRep --&gt; VM01\nMedRep --&gt; VM05\nMedRep --&gt; VM06\nMedRep --&gt; VM07\n\n&#39;================================\n&#39; EXTERNAL COMMUNICATION SERVICE\n&#39;================================\n\nMessaging --&gt; NT02\n\n@enduml\n&quot;,&#xa;  &quot;config&quot;: null&#xa;}" id="C0wFTU9llzARHMSiXnis-1">
